abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital assets associated with the article 'Styling \
  Maple graphics with TikZ and LaTeX'. That article discusses using TikZ and \
  LaTeX to style graphics produced by the Maple mathematics software package. \
  A graph of the standard cumulative distribution function was used to \
  demonstrate the technique."
